            ],
            3
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Differentiate the composite layer by layer: the cube gives 3 sin^2(5x), the sine gives cos(5x) evaluated at 5x, and 5x gives 5, so d/dx[sin^3(5x)] = 15 sin^2(5x) cos(5x).",
         "mathjson": [
